   "id": "frank.fixed.want",
   "who": "frank_nowak",
   "situation": "fixed",
   "text": "Thirty years, and that's the firm? An old man walking an envelope down to the water? Not for me. Every fare after dark, every door on this street, every quay with a rope on it: it goes through this office or it doesn't go. By Christmas, Ron. Mickey's runs the Hook. And when they say Mickey's, they'll mean me.",
   "once": "game",
   "src": "STORY-FRAME-2026-11-26 the want, night one (STORY-FRAME 1); the lead renamed Frank (decision of 24 Nov); TO CHECK against the story lane's scenes",
   "words": 59
  },
  {
   "id": "frank.fixed.car_three",
   "who": "frank_nowak",
